# S5-07 original startup-stack write post-IRET page walk — 2026-11-15

## Scope and provenance

One counted diagnostic run used schema-v5 execution observations with zero-based delivered-#PF ordinal 30. This is a single-run observation, not an N=2 series and not comparator evidence. It used `linux-direct --run --budget 3000000000 --set-cpl0 --cpuid-profile stage4a --user-mode --execution-observations-out ... --execution-observations-post-iret-index 30`, 128 MiB RAM, and nonce `od5postiretstack20261115c`. The guest loaded Linux, emitted its exact nonce, and reached the instruction-budget stop at `retired=2,999,999,998`.

